ass=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{NPC}\">\\(\\mathbf{NPC}\\)</span> (definition target)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{NPC}\\coloneqq\\{L\\in\\mathbf{NP}\\mid\\forall K\\in\\mathbf{NP}\\;(K\\leq_p L)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf{NPC}\\coloneqq\\{L\\in\\mathbf{NP}\\mid\\forall K\\in\\mathbf{NP}\\;(K\\leq_p L)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Consequences such as <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\mathbf{NPC}\\cap\\mathbf P\\to\\mathbf P=\\mathbf{NP}\">\\(L\\in\\mathbf{NPC}\\cap\\mathbf P\\to\\mathbf P=\\mathbf{NP}\\)</span> are theorems, not definition clauses.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-classNP","status":"resolved","id":"f8a4092aca6c1520","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-classNP]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-polyred","status":"resolved","id":"b12857db11f1d566","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-polyred]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-classNP","status":"resolved","id":"f8a4092aca6c1520","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf{NP}$ (complexity class, see [[27-df-classNP]])","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-polyred","status":"resolved","id":"b12857db11f1d566","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\leq_p$ (polynomial-time many-one reduction, see [[27-df-polyred]])","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbf{NP}","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq_p","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{NPC}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{NPC}\\coloneqq\\{L\\in\\mathbf{NP}\\mid\\forall K\\in\\mathbf{NP}\\;(K\\leq_p L)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"L\\in\\mathbf{NPC}\\cap\\mathbf P\\to\\mathbf P=\\mathbf{NP}","display":false}],"bytes":814,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-272","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-df-npcomplete|df-npcomplete — NP-complete languages]]"},{"id":"5841c816fcbc1014","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_n,\\mathrm{Eval}_n$ 见 [[27-df-boolexpr]]；$\\mathrm{encExpr}$ 见 [[27-df-encoding]]；$\\mathbf{NPC}$ 见 [[27-df-npcomplete]]。"}],"outgoing":["f8a4092aca6c1520","b12857db11f1d566"]}